Wed Oct 28 16:34:14 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- The shipped binary talks to org.freedesktop.portal.* (file chooser,
  screen share), but no portal frontend was declared, so those
  features fail with "No such interface" on a minimal install.
  Add weak Recommends on xdg-desktop-portal and
  xdg-desktop-portal-gtk - never a hard dependency on a desktop
  stack.

Tue Oct 20 23:33:20 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Declare the Flutter embedder's direct GTK3 soname Requires (libgtk-3,
  libgdk-3, libglib, libgobject, libgio, libatk, libcairo, libpango,
  libpangocairo, libfontconfig, libepoxy): auto-requires are disabled for
  the /opt payload, so these were only transitively satisfied via
  libayatana-appindicator3 and were not guaranteed on a minimal install.

